# Database archives must never be committed.
#
# T12 removed a tracked `backend/test_backup.dump`: a snapshot of the DEVELOPMENT
# database that entered history 82 seconds after it was written, swept into an
# unrelated commit. Nobody chose to commit it. It carried a real bcrypt password
# hash and eight refresh-token hashes, and by the time it was found it was nine
# migrations obsolete and could not have recovered anything.
#
# These patterns are narrow on purpose. `*.sql` is deliberately NOT ignored:
# Prisma migration SQL under backend/prisma/migrations/ is legitimate tracked
# source and must stay trackable.
*.dump
*.pgdump
*.backup

# Restores and exports occasionally land next to the code they were taken from.
*.dump.gz
*.pgdump.gz

# Playwright browser-UAT artefacts. The harness and its results format are
# committed; per-run output (screenshots, traces, seeded fixture ids) is not.
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/e2e-results/fixtures.json
frontend/e2e-results/results.json
